      "content": "<p><strong>To resolve offline dependency installation issues, you need to create two new notebooks with identical preinstalled library versions:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Utility Notebook (Setup Environment) <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/alexxxsem/nemotron-offline-dependencies\" target=\"_blank\">Example</a></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>File/Set as Utility Script</li>\n<li>Accelerator: GPU T4</li>\n<li>Internet: On</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>Competition Notebook (Offline Execution) (<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/alexxxsem/nemotron-simple-offline-working-demo\" target=\"_blank\">Example</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Attach to competition</p></li>\n<li><p>Accelerator: GPU RTX Pro 6000</p></li>\n<li><p>Internet: Off</p></li>\n<li><p>Add Input/Utility Scripts/<em>Your Utility Notebook</em></p>\n<p>You can use my notebooks, but over time version mismatch issues may appear.</p></li>\n</ul>",
      "feedbackTrackingData": {},
      "id": 3432601,
      "isThankYou": false,
