      "postDate": "2026-03-31T19:52:26.867Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "**To resolve offline dependency installation issues, you need to create two new notebooks with identical preinstalled library versions:**\n1. Utility Notebook (Setup Environment) [Example](https://www.kaggle.com/code/alexxxsem/nemotron-offline-dependencies)\n* File/Set as Utility Script\n* Accelerator: GPU T4\n* Internet: On\n2. Competition Notebook (Offline Execution) ([Example](https://www.kaggle.com/code/alexxxsem/nemotron-simple-offline-working-demo))\n* Attach to competition\n* Accelerator: GPU RTX Pro 6000\n* Internet: Off\n* Add Input/Utility Scripts/*Your Utility Notebook*\n\n You can use my notebooks, but over time version mismatch issues may appear.",
